# Stub: silences "hyprland-qtutils not installed" warning at Hyprland startup.
# Hyprland's CVersionKeeperManager checks for this binary; without it, the
# update-notification path logs a warning. Real binary lives in the
# hyprland-qtutils package, which conflicts with our Qt 6.10 stack on F43.
exit 0
